# Line endings are a correctness matter in this repository, not a preference.
#
# web/public/downloads/swamp.mjs carries the SHA-256 of its own body, and the verifier compares
# that hash against the bytes on disk. With core.autocrlf on, a Windows checkout would write
# CRLF into the file, the hash would stop matching, and the tool would refuse to prove anything
# for a reason that has nothing to do with cryptography. So every text file here is LF, on every
# platform, including the generated one.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Published artifacts are bytes, not text. A git filter must never touch them.
*.tgz binary
*.gz binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff2 binary
